ENTRY            40520   20211227   20220306   20220305       4203
SUBENT        40520001   20211227   20220306   20220305       4203
BIB                 14         94
TITLE       Fast neutron radiative capture cross-section for
           In-115, Ta-181, Au-197 and samarium and europium
           isotopes.
AUTHOR     (V.N.Kononov, B.D.Yurlov, G.N.Manturov, E.D.Poletaev,
           V.M.Timokhov, V.S.Shorin)
REFERENCE  ((R,YK-22,29,1977)=
           (R,INDC(CCP)-105,29,1977))
           Main reference. Experimental details.
           C-S on figures for In-115, Ta-181, Au-197,
           Eu-151,-153,-nat, Sm-147,-149 .
           (R,YFI-23,3,1977) C-S tables for In-115,Ta-181,Au-197,
           Eu-nat,-151,-153, Sm-147,-149.
            In INDC(CCP)-171 - only first author and title.
           (J,YF,26,947,1977) Issue 5. C-S on figures for In-115,
           Ta-181, Au-197,  Eu-151,-153,-nat, Sm-147,-149,-nat .
           (J,SNP,26,500,1977) Engl.translation of YF,26,947,1977
           (J,YF,27,10,1978) Issue 1
            Nd-142,-144,-146,148,150, Sm-144,-148,-150,-152,-154,
            Gd-156,-158,-160, Er-166,-168,170 c-s on figures.
           (J,SNP,27,5,1978) Engl.translation of YF,27,10,1978
           ((C,77KIEV,2,206,1977)=
           (R,INDC(CCP)-118,(2),206,1977)) INDC(CCP)-118-PART-II.
            Nd-142,-144,-146,148,150, Sm-144,-148,-150,-152,-154,
            Gd-156,-158,-160, Er-166,-168,170 C-S on figures.
           (R,INDC(CCP)-121,1,1978)
           Engl.translation of C,77KIEV,2,206,1977.
           ((C,77KIEV,2,211,1977)=
           (R,INDC(CCP)-118,(2),211,1977))  INDC(CCP)-118-PART-II.
           In-115, Ta-181, Au-197, Eu-151,-153, Sm-147,-149 C-S on
           figures.
           (R,INDC(CCP)-121,7,1978)
           Engl.translation of C,77KIEV,2,211,1977.
INSTITUTE  (4RUSFEI)
FACILITY   (VDG,4RUSFEI) FEI pulsed Van-de-Graaff
                    accelerator EG-1
INC-SOURCE (P-LI7) Metal lithium targets were used
METHOD     (TOF) Time-of-flight method
                    with time resolution 12. nsec/m and
                    7 nsec/m at 0.8 m and 1.4 m, respectively.
DETECTOR   (STANK) Liquid scintillation detector
                    with hexafluorobenzene,volume 17 liters.
                    B-10-plug and NaI(Tl)detector
MONITOR    (5-B-10(N,A)3-LI-7,,SIG)         Energy dependence of
                    neutron flux measured using
                    B-10(n,alpha gamma) reaction.
           ((MONIT)79-AU-197(N,G)79-AU-198,,SIG)
           Absolute normalization , 596.+-24.mb at 30 keV.
MONIT-REF  (,B.A.Magurno+,R,BNL-NCS-50464,1975)  Energy dependence
             as given by Magurno B.A.,ENDF/B-4 Cross
                    Section Measurement Standards,
                    BNL-NCS-50464,1975.
           ((MONIT)21848002,W.P.Poenitz+,J,JNE,22,505,1968)
                    For absolute normalization Au capture
                    cross-section at neutron energy 30.keV
CORRECTION  Background correction,corrections for the multiple
            neutron scattering, for resonance self-shielding and
            for isotopic impurities content .
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T)    All errors shown on the data are total
           (ERR-1,5.0,6.5) Systematic uncertainty of the
           detection efficiency 5.0-6.5 %.
           (ERR-2)    Standard uncertainties 5.0 % .
           (ERR-3,1.,3.)   Correction uncertainties 1.0-3.0 %.
           (ERR-S,1.0,12.) Statistical Error 12.0-1.0 %.
COMMENT    .Of compiler M.M 2014-08-08.
           Values of uncertainties given in articles
           - see C,77KIEV,2,211,1977, YK-22, YFI-23 :
           ERR-1 = 5.%,
           ERR-2 - 4% for Au and 2-3% for Li,
           ERR-3 - 6-0.5% for background correction, 3-1% for
           correction on finite thickness of sample,
           ERR-S - 0.5-4.% ,
           differ from given in ERR-ANALYS.
           Not corrected, because data (and maybe, also
           uncertainties ?) were received from authors.
           . In Entry 40513 - strength functions.
HISTORY    (19770124C)
           (19870312A) One author name corrected, data-errors
                     in COMMON section introduced, ISO-QUANT into
                     REACTION converted and references in proper
                     Subentries placed
           (19981103U)  Corrected by CJD
                       This data supersede old data in Subentries
                       40222002-40222003,40222006,
                       40222008-40222010,40222012-40222013
           (20050429C) Subent 003 Reaction code was corrected.
             Isotope contents were added in sample lines.
           (20050527U) Last checking has been done.
           (20140808A) M.M. Upper -> lower case correction.
           BIB information was updated.
           MONIT was added. COMMENT was added.
           References were added .
           (20201015U) J,SNP,27,5,1977 => J,SNP,27,5,1978 .
            Minor correction of free text in STATUS.
           (20211227U) MONIT code was added in MONIT-REF (JNE).
ENDBIB              94
